  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Salone Off-Grid Renewable Energy Acceleration (SOGREA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of SOGREA is to contribute to increased generation, improved accessibility and increased use of sustainable, affordable and reliable energy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SOGREA focuses on the following two outcomes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;1: To build generation and distribution infrastructure for sustainable, reliable and affordable energy and improve access to it (EU TEA AD Specific objective/Outcome 1)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Output 1.1:&lt;/u&gt; Developed infrastructure to generate and distribute electricity from renewable energies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Output 1.2:&lt;/u&gt; Promoted connections to the mini-grids.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Output 1.3:&lt;/u&gt; Supported initiatives to mitigate the environmental footprint of solar generation system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;2: To strengthen governance and financing of the renewable energy sector institutions (EU TEA AD Specific objective/Outcome 3)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Output 2.1:&lt;/u&gt; Strengthened regulatory and strategic planning capacity of energy sector institutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Output 2.2: &lt;/u&gt;Improved regulatory and investment framework.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
